OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will become confided to Orkney
OL,7,Fand Shetland this evening, Elsewhere
OL,8,Fany remaining showers will ease
OL,9,Fleaving patchy cloud and clearer
OL,10,Fspells. Rain moving into the southwest
OL,11,Flater with strengthening winds.
OL,12,FStaying warm for many overnight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FA band of heavy rain moves
OL,15,Feast across England and Wales,
OL,16,Fbrighter conditions follow with heavy,
OL,17,Fpossibly thundery showers. Staying dry
OL,18,Fbut rather cloudy across Scotland and
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland.
